# The built PMTiles archive, its sidecar and the metadata scratch. 60 MB of it, reproducible from
# build-la.sh, so none of it is committed - same rule as services/routing/work/ and services/etl/work/.
# Note WHERE it lives: the MAIN checkout's services/tiles/work/, never a worktree's, because
# `git worktree remove` deletes a worktree's ignored files with it.
work/
